Infects the target with a very contagious disease, doing [41, 55, 66, 75, 83 (TL1-5; SP 100)] damage per turn for 6 turns.

If any blight damage from non-diseases hits the target, the epidemic may activate and spread a random disease to nearby targets within a radius 2 ball.

The chance to spread increases with the blight damage dealt and is 100% if it is at least [37%, 30%, 25%, 22%, 19% (TL1-5)] of the target's maximum life.

Creatures suffering from that disease will also suffer healing reduction ([47%, 55%, 61%, 66%, 70% (TL1-5)]) and diseases immunity reduction ([31%, 40%, 46%, 51%, 55% (TL1-5)]).

Epidemic is an extremely potent disease; as such, it fully ignores the target's diseases immunity.

The damage will increase with your Spellpower, and the spread chance increases with the amount of blight damage dealt.
